<title>RUSSIA: Russian government wage arrears rise in May.</title>
<headline>Russian government wage arrears rise in May.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears due to a lack of financing from federal or regional governments rose to 11.02 trillion roubles in May from 10.76 trillion roubles in April, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS		June 2	Apr 28</p>
<p> wage arrears (government)	 11,017	10,761</p>
<p> wage arrears (companies)	  42,904	41,860</p>
<p> wage arrears (total)		53,921	52,621</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
